I love the idea of a non-target Oracle/Overwatch mission control type hero! Now that I think of it, I kind of can&#39;t believe they didn&#39;t do that very thing at some point. What a great trope to get into the Sentinels format.

Was the setup card something like this?

&quot;At the start of the game, reveal cards from the top of Parse&#39;s deck until two Ongoings are revealed. Put them into play. Discard the other revealed cards.

When one of your Ongoing cards would be destroyed, you may discard a card. If you do, prevent that destruction.

If you have no Ongoing cards in play, flip your character card to the incapacitated side.&quot;

[/quote]

That would be brutal against anything with mass ongoing destruction (devestating aurora, and Omnitron&#39;s darts come to mind)

You could add something like &quot;when one of your ongoings is destroyed, the rest of your ongoings become indestructable for the rest of that turn&quot;

